# Each attribute names a gate. `build` marks a path whose change must start Build, and
# `scripts` a path whose change must start the script tests. `-build` and `-scripts`
# mark a path whose change need not. Quality, Records, Commits and Sign-off always
# run, so none has an attribute.
#
# A gate reads the marks on the base branch, so a mark takes effect once it merges.
#
# A pattern that reaches the root, such as `*` or `*.rs`, marks a path before anyone
# decides it, and the lint then passes that path.
#
#   the task:  mise run lint:gates

.github/**                     -build  -scripts
.github/workflows/build.yml    build   -scripts
.github/workflows/scripts.yml  -build  scripts
.github/scripts/**             -build  scripts
.config/mise.toml              build   scripts
.config/mise.lock              build   scripts
.config/tasks.toml             build   scripts
.config/gates                  -build  -scripts
.config/readers                -build  -scripts
.config/cliff.toml             -build  scripts
/Cargo.toml                    build   -scripts
/Cargo.lock                    build   -scripts
/.cargo/config.toml            build   scripts
/.cargo/clippy.toml            build   scripts
crates/**                      build   -scripts
tests/**                       build   -scripts
/pyproject.toml                build   scripts
/README.md                     build   -scripts
/LICENSE                       build   -scripts
.gitignore                     build   -scripts
.gitattributes                 build   scripts

/AGENTS.md                     -build  -scripts
/CLAUDE.md                     -build  -scripts
/CONTEXT.md                    -build  -scripts
/CONTRIBUTING.md               -build  -scripts
/LANDSCAPE.md                  -build  -scripts
/.cargo/deny.toml              -build  -scripts
/prek.toml                     -build  -scripts
/.editorconfig                 -build  -scripts
/.shellcheckrc                 -build  -scripts
docs/**                        -build  -scripts
scripts/**                     -build  scripts
